  "description": "Introducing the Metolius, pronounced \"muh-TOLL-ee-us\", named after the national wild and scenic river in central Oregon. The Metolius is the latest culmination of Co-Motion tandem design and Bosch technology plus countless hours of testing and refining. This e-tandem is quite possibly the most versatile bicycle we've built to date and an absolute dream to ride.\nBased on a similar platform as the popular Steelhead road/ gravel tandem, the Metolius utilizes the most powerful Bosch Performance pedal-assist motor integrated with an electronic shifting Rohloff internally geared hub or SRAM AXS components for the ultimate riding experience. Ride farther with more comfort and less effort.\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels and 35-45mm tires\n\nExclusive super-strength zonally-butted cro-moly tubing\n\nTapered head tube with Co-Motion 1.5” TA carbon fork\n\nPowerful hydraulic disc brakes and 203mm rotors\n\nFront/ Rear rack + fender mounts\n\nGates Carbon Timing Belt\n\nBosch Performance mid-drive with 250w continuous output (max 600w)\n\nElectronic-shift integration designed for e-bike use\n\nClass III e-bike with support up to 28mph\n\nThe Metolius truly is a dream to ride, solid as a rock when it comes to performance, and is the most capable tandem you have ever used. Go further, go with ease.",
